  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&apos;s go back to nature</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Let&apos;s go back to nature</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;enie kvality &#x17e;ivota obyvate&#x13e;ov mesta Ro&#x17e;aje vybudovan&#xed;m outdoorov&#xe9;ho ihriska a vytvorenie tak podmienok na zmyslupln&#xe9; tr&#xe1;venie vo&#x13e;n&#xe9;ho &#x10d;asu, osobitne det&#xed; a ml&#xe1;de&#x17e;e.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the quality of life of the Ro&#x17e;aje&#xb4;s inhabitants by building an outdoor playground and creating conditions for meaningful leisure time, especially for children and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
